    "status": "cancelled",
    "assignee": "Architect",
    "attempt": 1,
    "attemptId": "att-1",
    "output": "CANCELLED-NOTE"
   },
   "threw": "task t1 is cancelled: the attempt rotation is REFUSED for terminal work — a terminal task is never re-armed (the record "
  },
  {
   "id": "refuse-failed",
